5. Practice 5: Quote two consecutive lines from a paired set of letters on the same event (or invent plausible PD-style lines). Explain the subtext and how a stage direction would change the reading.
6. Practice 6: Quote two consecutive lines from a drama scene with stage directions (or invent plausible PD-style lines). Explain the subtext and how a stage direction would change the reading.

### Answer key (quality bar)

