## Independent practice

Complete each item. Use complete sentences and text evidence where asked.

1. Practice 1: On a poem about a river crossing, mark (1) a claim-bearing sentence, (2) one charged word, (3) one structural move. Write a 2-sentence warrant linking mark #2 to meaning.
2. Practice 2: On an editorial on local civic life, mark (1) a claim-bearing sentence, (2) one charged word, (3) one structural move. Write a 2-sentence warrant linking mark #2 to meaning.
