*Grade 10 English Literature · Unit 9 of 10 · Media, Satire & Synthesis · Lesson 1*

## Objective

**I can** distinguish satire''s target from its surface jokes.

**Teacher focus:** Students ground every claim in text evidence and a warrant. Prefer precise verbs over vague praise.

## Warm-up (3–5 minutes)

